## Research Scope and Limitations

The reported experiments were conducted under specified controlled conditions.

In particular:

- The physics problem-solving evaluation used manually assisted structured inputs.
- The knowledge-composition experiments were also completed by a matched symbolic comparator.
- The trajectory prediction experiments used supplied motion laws.
- The current research does not establish fully autonomous real-world robotic operation.

The ongoing research aims to extend KNWM toward more general learning, perception, reasoning, and autonomous capability development.
